Sec. 3.1 predicts trace(Cov) ~ T^1 for policy gradients and T^0 for ES.
The ES prediction is exact by construction: grad log p(theta~;theta) = eps/sigma
carries no dependence on T, so any deviation from k=0 there is sampling noise.

